    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Played Orcish Bowmasters to ping the Cat Token instead of using Fatal Push to kill Ocelot Pride, the primary snowball threat. Ocelot Pride left alive can continue generating tokens whenever another creature deals combat damage. Bowmasters' flash ability is wasted by playing it on your own main phase rather than holding it for the opponent's draw step or as an instant-speed response.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Orcish Bowmasters during precombat main phase, which can only ping the Cat Token while leaving Ocelot Pride alive, and wastes the flash advantage.",
      "better_line": "Cast Fatal Push targeting Ocelot Pride to remove the token-generating engine for just 1 mana, then hold Orcish Bowmasters to flash in on opponent's turn for better value from its draw-trigger ability.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 29,
