      "decision_index": 21,
    },
    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "The Orcish Bowmasters ETB trigger deals 1 damage to any target and amasses Orcs 1. Targeting the Cat Token (1/1) kills it, which is fine, but targeting Ocelot Pride (1/1) would be significantly more impactful. Ocelot Pride is the engine that creates Cat tokens every end step when life is gained - it's the key threat that will snowball if left unchecked. The Cat Token is just a vanilla 1/1, while Ocelot Pride generates ongoing value. Killing Ocelot Pride with the 1 damage ping would remove the token-generating engine entirely.",
