    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Ocelot Pride is a 1/1 that generates tokens at end step whenever the opponent gains life. With lifelink on the Pride itself, it will create a cat token every turn it deals combat damage. This can snowball quickly. Fatal Push costs only {B} and Ocelot Pride has mana value 1, so it's a clean removal target. The opponent has Sacred Foundry and Arena of Glory tapped, meaning they likely can't protect it. Letting Ocelot Pride survive means it could attack next turn, gain life via lifelink, and create a token at end step, beginning to snowball.",
